  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="2a1f9b1a-f3f2-5fbd-9ad5-a08c76075313" activityNameId="2f507779-bb18-505a-a7bb-2e4ab6c4cb9c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Anode, lithium-ion battery, graphite, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Anode, lithium-ion battery, graphite, at plant
The dataset can be used as an anode for a lithium-ion battery. Data are based on patents. For infrastructure, the ecoinvent dataset "chemical plant, organics" is accounted. Transportation efforts are based on ecoinvent standard estimates.;
UUID: feeb5626-22fa-3e3c-934b-885604b04907
This dataset incudes the production of an anode for a lithium-ion battery. Active material is graphite, binder is LHB-108P (styrene butadiene) with the solvent water. Collector foil is copper, pretreated with H2SO4. The collector foil is coated on 1 side with the slurry (active material, binder, solvent and conductive carbon). Then, the coated foil is dried in a "dry channel" and then coiled up. The same procedure is done for the second side of the collector foil. 
Location: Some Swiss or  European datasets are used for global processes.
Technology: This dataset includes a method of producing an anode for a lithium ion battery. Graphite acts as a Li+-ion accumulator. Free Li+-ions move from the electrolyte into graphite layers (charge) or from the graphite layers back to the electrolyte (discharge). 
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: patent, website, ecoinvent 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: Uncertainty is assessed using the pedigree matrix.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_feeb5626-22fa-3e3c-934b-885604b04907.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="3142d8e2-0d30-557e-b090-9faae2b72357" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
